  CLAIMED    no_plan -- R9-UX-1: stylesheet only (narrative list and idle-explanation rules)
        --- /tmp/hpo-card-drift-fH9dkS/no_plan.d536fb4d64a9a4c27cd49bf63328f9bf8d2e0262	2026-10-01 21:06:47.722013041 +0000
