  CLAIMED    plan_inline_sv -- R9-UX-1: stylesheet only (narrative list and idle-explanation rules)
        --- /tmp/hpo-card-drift-kxXt7i/plan_inline_sv.d536fb4d64a9a4c27cd49bf63328f9bf8d2e0262	2026-10-01 21:06:47.754013043 +0000
