                 html="<div class=\"tt-time\">11:00 PM</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-price, #4a3aa7)\"></span>Electricity price: 0.8 SEK/kWh</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-dhw_slots, #d2403f)\"></span>DHW heating: 1.5 kW</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-space_slots, #2a78d6)\"></span>Space heating: 6 kW</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-outdoor, #3b7dd8)\"></span>Outdoor temperature: -9.2 °C</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-dhw_temp, #c2477a)\"></span>DHW tank temperature: 46 °C</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--hpo-series-dhw_temp, #c2477a) 0 3px,transparent 3px 6px)\"></span>Hot water, expected error: ±3 °C</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-house_temp, #008300)\"></span>House temperature: 17 °C</div><div class=\"tt-row\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--hpo-series-solar, #d4561f)\"></span>Solar irradiance: 52 W/m²</div><div class=\"tt-shared\">Shared step: the pump alternates circuits — hot water first. Combined 7.5 kW stays under the pump's maximum.</div><div class=\"tt-reason\">Leaving the house warm past the horizon</div>"
